            <div type="translation" xml:lang="en" resp="#AA">
                <p>To Imperator Caesar, grandson of the divine Severus Pius, son of the divine Antoninus Magnus Pius, Marcus Aurelius Severus [[Alexander Pius Felix Augustus]], pontifex maximus, with tribunician power for the 2nd time, consul, father of the fatherland. The [people] of Como devotes [this] to his numen and majesty, by decree of the decurions.</p>
            </div>
